                "_fields": {
                  "value": {
                    "_type": "Constant",
                    "_fields": {
                      "value": "Minimal circuit breaker with CLOSED / OPEN / HALF_OPEN states.\n\n    This is intentionally simple and process-local; higher-level\n    orchestration (e.g. batch runner) is responsible for coordinating\n    breakers across workers if needed.\n    ",
